on the grid is one unit.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.320
So each of these is one unit.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.650
Which of the following
sequences of transformations

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:22.567
maps triangle PQR onto triangle ABC?

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:27.780
So we have four different
sequences of transformations,

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.560
and so why don't you pause this video

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:32.725
