00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:07.790
so one way to think about it is,

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.190
a line like that is then
going to be like that.

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:13.690
So we're going to go like that.

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:17.080
And so R is going to stay where it is.

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.830
You're rotating about it.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:23.520
But P is now going to be right over here.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:26.440
One way to think about
it is to go from R to P,

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:29.380
