00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:45.030
So that is P.

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:50.030
And then Q is going to go right over here.

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:52.760
It's going to, once again,

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:56.500
