00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.730
And so after you do
the 90-degree rotation,

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:02.550
PQR is going to look like this.

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.510
So that is Q.

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:05.630
So we've done that first part.

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:09.580
Then a translation six units to the left

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.294
and seven units up.

00:02:11.294 --> 00:02:15.060
So each of these points
are going to go six units

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:16.780
