00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.550
So if we take point P,

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:22.720
six to the left, one, two,
three, four, five, six,

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:27.720
seven units up, one, two,
three, four, five, six, seven.

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:31.710
